{
  "id": "JHN.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Johana 2",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu oloko pi divai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiengʼ mar adek, arus moro ne nitie Kana, e piny Galili. Min Yesu ne ni kanyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo Yesu gi jopuonjrene bende noluongi e arusno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane divai orumo, min Yesu nowachone niya, \"Divai mane jogi nigo oserumo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachone niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Mama, angʼo momiyo idwaro mondo atim ma to sana pok ochopo?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka min-gi nowachone jotich niya, \"Timuru gimoro amora monyisou.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To machiegni kanyo ne nitie degi auchiel mag pi, mane gin kaka degi ma jo-Yahudi ne tiyogo kuom logo e yor pwodhruok, ma moro ka moro ne tingʼo pi madirom depe ariyo kata adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nowachone jotich niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Pongʼuru degnigi gi pi\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; mine gipongʼogi thich.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka nonyisogi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Koro tuomuru pi moko mondo ukaw uter ne jatend budho.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 2:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Negitimo kamano,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo jatend budho nobilo pi mane koro oselokore divai. Ne ok ofwenyo kuma ne ogolee, kata obedo ni jotich mane otuomo pi to nongʼeyo. Eka noluongo wuon kisera tenge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo nowachone niya, \"Ji mangʼeny kuongo kelo divai maber eka bangʼe gikelo divai maboth ka welo osemetho momer to in to ne ikano divai maber mogik nyaka sani.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ranyisi mar hono mokwongoni Yesu notimo e dala Kana e piny Galili. Nonyiso duongʼne kuom timne, kendo jopuonjrene noyie kuome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu oriembo jo-ohala e hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼ mano nodhi Kapernaum kaachiel gi min-gi gi owetene kod jopuonjrene. Negibet kuno kuom ndalo manok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kinde mag Pasaka mar jo-Yahudi ne chiegni chopo, Yesu nodhi Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ei agola mag hekalu, noyudo ka ji hono dhok gi rombe kod akuche, kendo jomoko to nobet olworo mesni ka giwilo pesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo noloso del gi piende molir olir, kendo noriembo ji duto oko ei hekalu, kod rombe gi dhok bende. Nokeyo pesa mag jowil pesa, kendo noloko mesnigi ataro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Johala mag akuche to nowachonegi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Goluru gigi oko ka! Ngʼa monyisou mondo ulok od Wuora chiro!\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.2.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.2.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jopuonjrene noparo gima nondiki niya, \"Hera matut ma aherogo odi tieka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka jo-Yahudi nowachone niya, \"Ranyisi mar hono mane minyalo nyisowa mondo osir teko mitimogo gigi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nodwokogi niya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Mukuru hekaluni, to abiro gere kendo bangʼ ndalo adek.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.2.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.2.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo-Yahudi nodwoke niya, \"Gero hekaluni osekawo higni piero angʼwen gauchiel, to in to ere kaka inyalo gere gi ndalo adek?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To hekalu mane owuoyo kuome ne en ringre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼ kane osechier oa kuom joma otho, jopuonjrene noparo gima nowachono. Omiyo ne giyie kuom Ndiko kod weche mane Yesu osewacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane pod en Jerusalem e Sap Pasaka, ji mangʼeny noneno ranyisi mag honni mane otimo mine giyie kuom nyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yesu ne ok ochiwore e lwetgi, nimar nongʼeyo pach ji duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ok odwar mondo ngʼato onyise wach moro kuom dhano wadgi nimar nongʼeyo gik manie chuny dhano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JHN.3",
